  "claim": {
    "component_id": "C012.component",
    "value": "Every removal must have an explicit operational counterpart, with replay omission of an earlier booking, elimination of a redundant handoff and immediate readiness communication offered as examples.",
    "scope": "Meaning of component removals in the proposed reduction tests; examples are not established remedies.",
