        }
      ],
      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "P010 supplies the requirement and examples. P011 limits the earlier-booking example to diagnostic use, and P023 makes translation into changes dependent on test support."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C012.signal_basis",
    "value": "Group removals or complement tests keep equipment, the agreed deadline and other test conditions fixed, with each removal assigned an explicit operational counterpart. The observed pattern is a smaller configuration that repeatedly remains late while specified further removals cease to reproduce lateness.",
    "scope": "Reduction tests of the selected reconstructed late case, using a common repetition rule and treating uncertain or inconsistent outcomes as unresolved.",
