          "source_id": "P018",
          "role": "SUPPORT"
        }
      ],
      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "The cited spans establish the selected replay, controlled removal procedure, operational correspondence requirement, repetition rule and informative signal."
    }
  },
  "stated_empirical_relation": {
    "component_id": "C012.stated_empirical_relation",
    "value": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
    "scope": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
    "provenance": {
      "refs": [],
      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "The claim specifies how removals are operationalized; no unresolved empirical relation is needed to license that procedural requirement."
    }
  },
  "rationale": "The claim is a bounded operational specification explicitly supplied by the mapping. Assigning concrete counterparts gives the tested removals operational meaning. Neither the requirement nor its examples assert that those changes remedy late starts, so the observed reduction signal need not establish their field effectiveness.",
  "uncertainty": "No material uncertainty for this procedural claim under the stipulated execution assumptions.",
